# Generated native projects — intentionally fully ignored. This app uses
# Expo's managed workflow + EAS Build, which regenerates android/ (and ios/)
# from app.config.js on every build. If this ever switches to a committed
# "bare" workflow, replace these two lines with the narrower
# android/.gradle/, android/app/build/, android/build/ patterns instead.
/ios
/android
